<title>PORTUGAL: Yld eases to 6.01 pct on Portugal one-year bills.</title>
<headline>Yld eases to 6.01 pct on Portugal one-year bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 6.005 percent, from 6.0181 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 364-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Treasury placed all of the 10 billion escudos on offer. The last such sale was on December 5.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
